=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: swapping the pytest hook for a tox hook keeps a runner in the inventory
origin: issue #181 bound — the runner-swap carve-out row 69 makes for scripts
origin2: (runner_script_switched_runner_neg), in the hook inventory's dialect.
=== before: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: pytest
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
=== after: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: tox
        name: tox
        entry: tox -e py
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
